msgctxt "108"
msgid "I wonder if he's coming...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid "Hey..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "Something wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "No, no. It's just that, uh... Well, it's about the lottery ticket..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "When I took it to get the money, they told me it was from a month ago..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"So it's an old ticket, and I didn't win squat. They even confirmed it with "
"the machine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"But you know what, I actually feel a huge sense of relief. I was going a "
"bit crazy when I thought I'd had all that money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "Good thing I found out before I quit my job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "Money makes me sick. I mean, I was acting like a raving lunatic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"I imagine most people would go a little cuckoo if they thought they'd won "
"that much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"Sorry for putting you through all that drama. I can't even look at money "
"right now. Please, take this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "You got <Color:8>10,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "You sure about this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"Positive. I'm gonna walk home tonight and cool off in the fresh night "
"air... So long, buddy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "You got 2,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid ""
"Whew... I feel much better. Now all I gotta do is take a taxi to the "
"exchange center. Thanks for the help, buddy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "So..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"All right, all right. Hold your horses. I'll pay you once I get the "
"300,000,000!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "Let's meet up right at this spot, okay? Come back for me later!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "Trust me on this, I'm an honest guy. See ya later!"
msgstr ""

